  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-306(a)(5)): (5) except as provided in subsection (b) of this section, has successfully completed prior to application and each renewal, a firearms training course approved by the Secretary that includes: (i) 1. for an initial application, a minimum of 6 hours of instruction by a qualified handgun instructor; or 2. for a renewal application, 2 hours of instruction by a qualified handgun instructor;"
